        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Princess Mafalda of Savoy, Princess Mafalda of Saxony, Umberto I of Italy\n- Places: Italy\n- Topics: Ship names, royal succession\n\nFacts:\n- SS Principessa Mafalda was not named after Princess Mafalda of Savoy.\n- SS Principessa Mafalda was named after Princess Mafalda of Saxony.\n- Princess Mafalda of Savoy had a younger brother, Umberto I of Italy, who became king.\n- Umberto I of Italy reigned for 34 days.",
